+test_leader_pick covers Golan's merge-ready system line and its pill.
+res_web and views_web failed since the picker replaced the title (they
+tapped the Magician through the open grid; same failures on the
+pre-mobile build): they pick הפתעה first. share_web's About invite no
+longer requires ביבי (the invite is leader-neutral since the picker).
